<newsitem itemid="119902" id="root" date="1996-10-16" xml:lang="en">
<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Chillers posts maiden interim profit,no div.</title>
<headline>Chillers posts maiden interim profit,no div.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended Aug 31 vs pro forma 12 months ended Feb 28, 1997</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)     3.0	   vs 10.7</p>
<p>    Attrib income	   0.65	  vs 2.30</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   0.98	  vs 3.50</p>
<p>    Tax			 0.33	  vs 1.20</p>
<p>    Interest paid	   0.67	  vs 1.90</p>
<p>    Turnover		  22.70	 vs 56.00</p>
<p>Full name: Chillers Group Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - As the group was only listed on the Johannesburg Stock Exchange on June 19, 1996 comparative results are pro forma.</p>
<p>Directors said, barring a material deterioration in the economy, they are optimistic that budgeted profits for the year will be achieved.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
